<body>
  <%- include('./partials/nav') %>
  <main class="container-fluid p-3 info-container">
    <div class="intro">
      <h1 class="text-center">Your character, ready for whatever happens</h1>
      <p>D&amp;D 5E character sheets you can edit as you play. Add spells and equipment with SRD autofill, keep attack bonuses tied to your stats, and make room for your table’s homebrew.</p>
      <div class="seo-cta-block"><a class="seo-cta-primary" href="/register">Create a free account</a> <a class="seo-cta-secondary" href="/character-sheet-guide">Read the sheet guide</a>
      </div><hr>
    </div>
    <section id="why-better">
      <h2>Make changes while the story moves</h2>
      <p>Found a strange weapon? Learned a spell? Changed a house rule?</p>
      <p>Edit your attacks, spells, gear, stats, and notes directly. Adjust the details when you need to, including custom content your group brings to the game.</p>
      <figure class="toolshot-card">
        <img src="/assets/screen_shots/character_sheet_adren.png" alt="D&amp;D 5E character sheet showing stats, abilities, and attacks." loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>Keep your character’s stats, attacks, and notes ready for play.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>
    <section id="magic-numbers">
      <h2>Let your attack bonuses follow your stats</h2>
      <p>Use expressions such as <code>dex+pro</code> in attack bonus fields to calculate a bonus from your Dexterity modifier and proficiency.</p>
      <p>When those values change, the calculated bonus updates with them.</p>
      <p>Less recalculating. More attention on your next move.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="srd-autofill">
      <h2>Spend less time copying spell descriptions</h2>
      <p>Search SRD suggestions to fill in spell details, including casting time, range, duration, and components.</p>
      <p>Equipment and magic-item suggestions help with gear, too. Available reference links let you check the source details during play.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="campaign-play">
      <h2>Keep your group in the loop</h2>
      <p>Share a sheet through an invite link for collaborative character management.</p>
      <p>Link it to a Wyrld so campaign editors can access the character alongside the campaign’s other resources.</p>
      <a class="seo-cta-secondary" href="/wyrlds">Explore Wyrlds</a>
    </section>
    <section id="copies">
      <h2>Take a copy. Try a variation.</h2>
      <p>Export a printable PDF for the table or a session backup.</p>
      <p>Duplicate a sheet when you want to experiment with a different build while keeping your current character intact.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="start-now">
      <h2>Bring your character to the next session</h2>
      <div class="seo-cta-block"><a class="seo-cta-primary" href="/register">Create a free account</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
